# Line endings: keep the source as LF so Windows checkouts do not rewrite
# every file and produce noise in diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# NOTE: assets/video/*.mp4 is deliberately NOT tracked by Git LFS.
# GitHub Pages does not resolve LFS objects — it serves the pointer file
# verbatim, so an LFS-tracked video plays as a 133-byte text file on the live
# site. assets/video/LOVE-BUDS.mp4 is embedded in about-us.html, so it has to
# be a real blob in the repo.
#
# If the videos ever move to object storage (Cloudflare R2 or similar), drop
# them from the repo entirely rather than re-enabling LFS here.
*.mp4 -text
*.jpg -text
*.jpeg -text
*.png -text
*.webp -text
*.woff2 -text
*.pdf -text
